    {
      "text": "You can view, edit, clone, delete, or organize security policies at global, template, or site levels. The system (default) policies created for each site are editable but cannot be reordered."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Editing a Policy",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit a policy:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Branch > Security > Device Segmentation Policy. Click the tab for the scope (Global Policy, Template Policy, or Site Policy) that includes the policy you want to edit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          49
        ],
        [
          52,
          60
        ],
        [
          63,
          82
        ],
        [
          83,
          89
        ],
        [
          120,
          133
        ],
        [
          135,
          150
        ],
        [
          155,
          166
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the policy that you want to edit, click the corresponding Gear icon, and select Edit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          65,
          69
        ],
        [
          87,
          91
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit Policy drawer, make the necessary changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The policy changes are saved.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Commit to apply the changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reordering Policies",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "You can reorder policies to change the order of evaluation."
    },
    {
      "text": "To reorder policies:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Zero Trust Branch > Security > Device Segmentation Policy. Click the tab for the scope (Global Policy, Template Policy, or Site Policy) under which you want to reorder policies.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          23
        ],
        [
          26,
          34
        ],
        [
          37,
          56
        ],
        [
          57,
          63
        ],
        [
          94,
          107
        ],
        [
          109,
          124
        ],
        [
          129,
          140
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Reorder.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "A Drag icon appears for each custom policy.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          2,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Use the Drag icon to rearrange the policies as required. You can either click and drag the policies using the Drag icon or click the Drag icon to select the policy name, after which the policy must be inserted.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          8,
          12
        ],
        [
          110,
          114
        ],
        [
          133,
          137
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save Policy Order.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
